    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the spirit world! You might not remember how you got here, but don\u2019t worry\u2014Alan, the cutest (and grumpiest) poultry-geist, has a plan! In this farm-to-table cooking game help Alan restore a rundown Japanese restaurant, serve delicious meals, harvest fresh crops, and prepare special ingredients to meet all your customers\u2019 needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079770/extras/dea4d458ae1a287016af1ad51448c338.poster.avif?t=1752441897\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079770/extras/dea4d458ae1a287016af1ad51448c338.webm?t=1752441897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079770/extras/dea4d458ae1a287016af1ad51448c338.mp4?t=1752441897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Manage Your Restaurant:</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose the menu</strong> that you want to serve each day. Experiment with new recipes and cater to what you think your customers will enjoy the most!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance your <strong>time </strong>and <strong>quality </strong>of each dish to keep your customers happy and <strong>earn money</strong> for future upgrades!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare meals </strong>to put on your takeaway tables and meet the needs of customers on the go!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079770/extras/3f964c34e34ef09af93260b2a87535a5.poster.avif?t=1752441897\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079770/extras/3f964c34e34ef09af93260b2a87535a5.webm?t=1752441897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079770/extras/3f964c34e34ef09af93260b2a87535a5.mp4?t=1752441897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Farm-to-Table Cooking:</strong></i>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Water </strong>and <strong>harvest</strong> ingredients from your very own garden! Use these ingredients to create the freshest meals for your ghostly friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure to take special care of your <strong>cows </strong>and <strong>chickens</strong> so that you can have fresh milk and eggs everyday!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>mini-games</strong> to prepare certain ingredients for your recipes. Ferment soybeans to make your own soy sauce, dry green tea leaves to create your own matcha powder, and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079770/extras/fe89557252798445927e07f41083b0cc.poster.avif?t=1752441897\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079770/extras/fe89557252798445927e07f41083b0cc.webm?t=1752441897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079770/extras/fe89557252798445927e07f41083b0cc.mp4?t=1752441897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Purchase Items &amp; Upgrades:</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure to <strong>manage your finances</strong> so that you have enough funds to make purchases for your shop and yourself. Purchase new plants for your farm, decorations for your bedroom, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend points to <strong>purchase upgrades </strong>to restore your shop, add extra elements to your kitchen, and activate other elements that make running your restaurant even easier!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079770/extras/27079be51f61bc27d5094a90c6c5926a.poster.avif?t=1752441897\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079770/extras/27079be51f61bc27d5094a90c6c5926a.webm?t=1752441897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079770/extras/27079be51f61bc27d5094a90c6c5926a.mp4?t=1752441897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Explore the NPCs:</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something has been missing from this restaurant for a long time. Learn about <strong>Alan\u2019s history</strong> with the restaurant and help him find his missing piece!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >According to Alan, this restaurant used to have some <strong>regulars</strong>. When they come into the restaurant, complete their <strong>challenge </strong>to learn more about the history of your store!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the spirit world! You might not remember how you got here, but don\u2019t worry\u2014Alan, the cutest (and grumpiest) poultry-geist, has a plan! In this farm-to-table cooking game help Alan restore a rundown Japanese restaurant, serve delicious meals, harvest fresh crops, and prepare special ingredients to meet all your customers\u2019 needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079770/extras/dea4d458ae1a287016af1ad51448c338.poster.avif?t=1752441897\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079770/extras/dea4d458ae1a287016af1ad51448c338.webm?t=1752441897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079770/extras/dea4d458ae1a287016af1ad51448c338.mp4?t=1752441897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Manage Your Restaurant:</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose the menu</strong> that you want to serve each day. Experiment with new recipes and cater to what you think your customers will enjoy the most!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance your <strong>time </strong>and <strong>quality </strong>of each dish to keep your customers happy and <strong>earn money</strong> for future upgrades!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare meals </strong>to put on your takeaway tables and meet the needs of customers on the go!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079770/extras/3f964c34e34ef09af93260b2a87535a5.poster.avif?t=1752441897\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079770/extras/3f964c34e34ef09af93260b2a87535a5.webm?t=1752441897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079770/extras/3f964c34e34ef09af93260b2a87535a5.mp4?t=1752441897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Farm-to-Table Cooking:</strong></i>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Water </strong>and <strong>harvest</strong> ingredients from your very own garden! Use these ingredients to create the freshest meals for your ghostly friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure to take special care of your <strong>cows </strong>and <strong>chickens</strong> so that you can have fresh milk and eggs everyday!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>mini-games</strong> to prepare certain ingredients for your recipes. Ferment soybeans to make your own soy sauce, dry green tea leaves to create your own matcha powder, and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079770/extras/fe89557252798445927e07f41083b0cc.poster.avif?t=1752441897\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079770/extras/fe89557252798445927e07f41083b0cc.webm?t=1752441897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079770/extras/fe89557252798445927e07f41083b0cc.mp4?t=1752441897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Purchase Items &amp; Upgrades:</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure to <strong>manage your finances</strong> so that you have enough funds to make purchases for your shop and yourself. Purchase new plants for your farm, decorations for your bedroom, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend points to <strong>purchase upgrades </strong>to restore your shop, add extra elements to your kitchen, and activate other elements that make running your restaurant even easier!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079770/extras/27079be51f61bc27d5094a90c6c5926a.poster.avif?t=1752441897\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079770/extras/27079be51f61bc27d5094a90c6c5926a.webm?t=1752441897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3079770/extras/27079be51f61bc27d5094a90c6c5926a.mp4?t=1752441897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Explore the NPCs:</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something has been missing from this restaurant for a long time. Learn about <strong>Alan\u2019s history</strong> with the restaurant and help him find his missing piece!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >According to Alan, this restaurant used to have some <strong>regulars</strong>. When they come into the restaurant, complete their <strong>challenge </strong>to learn more about the history of your store!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "In this delightful farm-to-table cooking game, you\u2019ll restore a cozy Japanese restaurant, cultivate a bountiful garden of fresh ingredients, and prepare mouth-watering Japanese dishes for hungry locals. Use your culinary skills to help bring a little life back to the spirit world!",
